{
  "name": "ark-std",
  "description": "A specialized compatibility layer and standard library abstraction for the arkworks zkSNARK ecosystem, designed to facilitate development in restricted no_std environments. It provides essential primitives including specialized I/O traits, error handling, performance tracing macros, and deterministic random number generation for cryptographic testing. The library also introduces a streaming model abstraction through custom iterable traits to support high-performance vector and matrix operations required for zero-knowledge proof systems.",
